---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---
<InfoPage
  title="Terms"
  description="Guidelines for using iLoveMyFiles and its browser-based tools."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <section aria-labelledby="terms-use">
    <h2 id="terms-use">Using the site</h2>
    <p>You may use this site and its tools for lawful purposes. Do not misuse the site, interfere with its operation, or attempt to access systems or data without authorization.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="terms-results">
    <h2 id="terms-results">Tools and results</h2>
    <p>Tools and features are provided for general use and may change or become unavailable. Review outputs before relying on them, and keep an original copy of important files. You are responsible for confirming that a result meets your requirements and any applicable rules.</p>
    <p>Where a tool uses a third-party service, that service may be subject to its own terms and policies.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="terms-contact">
    <h2 id="terms-contact">Questions</h2>
    <p>For questions about these terms, contact <a href="mailto:ilovemyfiles.com@gmail.com">ilovemyfiles.com@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</InfoPage>
